{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":718342,\"title\":\"Tommy - Lost in the Jungle\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Jenny and her baby brother Tommy were born in the Amazon jungle. Their parents, dedicated archeologists, were attacked by tribal warriors. The family was separated, Tommy was carried off by a tribal wise man to be raised among the animals and Jenny was taken to the city by her grandfather.  Years later, once she is grown, Jenny returns to the jungle to find her brother. During the adventure she encounters poachers, fierce creatures, a hidden city, ancient treasure, and finally Tommy.  Together they struggle to escape the dangers of the wild.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tlHinbS8f7MzmHXvssyijL6d7ce.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3hN9C0g5DLsi7IoVpoqVSnhYTkB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1999,\"runtime\":41,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Alessandro Bulath\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2689051,\"name\":\"Alessandro Bulath\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1397612,\"name\":\"Simone D'Andrea\",\"character\":\"Tommy (voce)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lBBjvkzxxmPsZIe7a9NVypQeYFC.jpg\"},{\"id\":4503340,\"name\":\"Sonia Mazza\",\"character\":\"Jenny (voce)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3yMC1mclioWCr4dNjG4Cop4kyDV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1904528,\"name\":\"Massimiliano Lotti\",\"character\":\"Capo (voce)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rlpFzHaJV6U3LfsfNs2Ng2KAj4J.jpg\"},{\"id\":4503343,\"name\":\"Roberta Gallina\",\"character\":\"Lucy (voce)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2228437,\"name\":\"Augusto Di Bono\",\"character\":\"Felipe (voce)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/LJqtGUNn94UNBaYtONHeOH2vRA.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjTqY5coNiz6sVtPng40IzltsoN.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354912,\"title\":\"Coco\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Ryitt95xrO8KXuqRGm1fUuNwqF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g7CHF8gTLGooTbP4GznIGwaqAGL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel's family history.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1204680,\"title\":\"Coyote vs. Acme\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kYDCl2y0VPvhT5eYWbMRInPoB03.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rueyXwlewVPAP5NkqCUJx4RjhqB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Acme products fail him one too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner, Wile E. Coyote decides to hire a billboard lawyer to sue the Acme Corporation.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084242,\"title\":\"Zootopia 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgotja3xMoJZbynwHfcQcJAEMWH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia's history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":153518,\"title\":\"The Angry Birds Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOH0fEFtV9z9rZp9zmBFGGeWicv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o4mhrLxv6I70kvYA42qANGUF7ya.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An island populated entirely by happy, flightless birds or almost entirely. In this paradise, Red, a bird with a temper problem, speedy Chuck, and the volatile Bomb have always been outsiders. But when the island is visited by mysterious green piggies, it’s up to these unlikely outcasts to figure out what the pigs are up to.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1327819,\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u53UYu5XG2hNgWGvs3xGhAVzypl.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Scientists have discovered how to 'hop' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1007757,\"title\":\"Swapped\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHhxWxge06goXU6ZQH1hj7vK8Hd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zMwhWailP1WY7sb6AoE6b8ugoy.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A small woodland creature and a majestic bird, two natural sworn enemies of the Valley, magically trade places and set off on an adventure of a lifetime to switch back. Their journey soon uncovers a greater threat—one that could endanger not only their species, but the entire valley they call home.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1185806,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxXSF4aY5N2cOGwaga5OnpPFHzk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dY4LyVSvjk9dN20YsxuouaMIMox.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a storm, where they meet Rex, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless mining triggers a volcano, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet to save the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"tEBnTpVh95g\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"BAFkCkUmFbs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Hkeg5t4upuY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86